                <p class="font-sans text-[9px] md:text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold text-accent mb-2">Core Capabilities</p>
                <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Full-Spectrum Audio Craft</h2>
            </div>

            <!-- Bento Grid of Services -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
                <!-- Service 1: Drama & Cinema OST -->
                <div class="bento-border p-6 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between group gs-reveal">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent text-sm font-bold">01</span>
                            <span class="font-sans text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10">Original Soundtracks</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Drama & Cinema OST Composing</h3>
                        <p class="font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Crafting signature melodies and themes that amplify television drama emotions and cinematic storytelling. Complete arrangement including vocal orchestration, acoustic strings, traditional instruments, and modern synthesizers.
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Melodic composition & harmonic arrangement</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Character leitmotifs & emotional climax cues</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Multi-channel broadcast & OTT stems</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-400">Typical Delivery: <strong class="text-white">5–7 Business Days</strong></span>
                        <a href="contact.html?service=ost" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent hover:underline flex items-center gap-1.5">Inquire <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 2: Film Score & BGM -->
                <div class="bento-border p-6 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between group gs-reveal">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent text-sm font-bold">02</span>
                            <span class="font-sans text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10">Cinematic Score</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Background Score (BGM) & Foley</h3>
                        <p class="font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Architecting ambient soundscapes, psychological tension layers, and impact hits synced frame-by-frame with film visual dynamics. Seamlessly elevates drama narrative without overpowering actor dialogue.
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Frame-accurate timeline synchronization</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Sub-bass tension design & foley integration</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> 5.1 Surround / Stereo theatrical stems</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-400">Typical Delivery: <strong class="text-white">Custom per episode/scene</strong></span>
                        <a href="contact.html?service=bgm" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent hover:underline flex items-center gap-1.5">Inquire <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 3: Vocal Booth Tracking -->
                <div class="bento-border p-6 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between group gs-reveal">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent text-sm font-bold">03</span>
                            <span class="font-sans text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10">Studio Tracking</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Acoustic Vocal Booth Sessions</h3>
                        <p class="font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Recording vocal performances in an acoustically decoupled booth tuned for zero standing waves and absolute proximity clarity. Fed directly through boutique microphone preamplifiers without coloration.
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Floating acoustic isolation booth in Niketon, Dhaka</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> High-end large diaphragm condenser microphones</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Pitch correction, vocal comping & sibilance control</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-400">Session Rate: <strong class="text-white">Per Hour or Flat Package</strong></span>
                        <a href="contact.html?service=vocal" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent hover:underline flex items-center gap-1.5">Inquire <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 4: Mixing & Mastering -->
                <div class="bento-border p-6 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between group gs-reveal">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-accent text-sm font-bold">04</span>
                            <span class="font-sans text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10">Audio Engineering</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">Reference Mixing & Mastering</h3>
                        <p class="font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Surgical dynamic balancing, phase alignment, analog summing, and harmonic enhancement on calibrated German ADAM Audio monitors. Delivers punchy low-end, silky top-end, and international broadcast loudness.
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Broadcast compliance (EBU R128 & ITU-R BS.1770-4)</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> Streaming optimization for YouTube, Spotify & Apple Music</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 font-sans"><i class="fas fa-check text-accent text-[10px]"></i> 24-bit 48kHz WAV + Stems (Instrumental, TV, Acapella)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
